COMPILATION OF: E46L4

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program
S: Symbol Table List

  SYMBOLS:

BLOCK AT LINE 1, AUTO STORAGE 0 BYTES
a 0000 E46L4 ENTRY PARAMETERS(0) EXTERNAL CONSTANT
BLOCK AT LINE 3, AUTO STORAGE 4 BYTES
c 0000 OUTF FILE EXTERNAL STATIC
c 0000 Z FIXED DECIMAL(6,0) AUTOMATIC
   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46L4

   1 a 0000 E46L4:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 c 0006   dcl outf file, z fixed dec(6);
   4 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('L4OUT DAT');
   5 c 0023   put file(outf) list(z);
   6 c 0044   put list(z);
   7 c 0062   close file(outf);
   8 a 0068 end E46L4;

CODE SIZE = 006B
DATA AREA = 000D
FREE SYMS = 38A8
